  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "千里迢迢ê siàu念──Siàu念張炎憲教授"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<span style=\"font-family: 華康儷中宋; font-size: 14pt;\">◎陳胤</span><br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">風涼</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">--ah</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">。竟然</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">　&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">Ùi</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">美國開始落雨</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">千里迢迢，一路落</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">--</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">轉</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">來</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">　 你我每日</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">siàu</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">念</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">島嶼</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">太平洋</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">leh</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">講，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">tse m̄</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">是雨</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">每一片閃</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">sih\nê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">海波浪</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\nLóng</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">是歷史</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">m̄</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">甘</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">目屎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">滿滿，寫</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">tī</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">坎坷</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">土地面頂</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">種一欉樹仔，叫</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">做「</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">夢想</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">」</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">用血汗，</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">kā</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">搖籃內</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">祖國</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">　 一寸一寸，</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">tshiâⁿ</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">養大漢</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">你我</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">siàu</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">念</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">目神</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">恬恬流</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">做</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">一條溫暖</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">大河</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">一群</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">gōng-gōng</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">犁頭</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê tsheⁿ-mê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">牛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">Mā</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">開始看</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">bat</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">愛</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">」</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">tsit</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">字，漸漸</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">　 踏著你勇敢</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">跤步</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">風涼</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">--ah</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">。</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">Suah</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">換心</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">leh</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">落雨</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">秋夜更深，總是有落葉</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">月娘</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">目尾，此時此刻</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">猶原</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">koh</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">含</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">（</span><span lang=\"NL\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">kâm</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">一粒</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">　&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">Beh</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">滴未滴</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\">露水</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%;\"><o:p></o:p></span></div>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt;\">Tse</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt;\">是我千里迢迢</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt;\">哀愁</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt;\"><br />\n</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt;\">　&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Taigi Unicode'; font-size: 14pt;\">Ê siàu</span><span style=\"font-family: 標楷體; font-size: 14pt;\">念</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 14pt;\">……</span><br />\n<br />\n<span style=\"color: purple;\">註解：<br /><br /> 一世人為台灣文化走tsông ê歷史學者──前國史館館長、現任台灣社社長張炎憲教授，9--月去美國進行二二八事件口述歷史訪問，9月26因為急性ê心臟中風入院，10月初3不幸tī美國過身，享年67歲。M̄甘，用一首tâm-tâm ê詩，siàu念伊。</span><div>\n<span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: purple;\"><br /></span></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: white;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">= = = END = = =</span></span></div>\n"
  },
